    },
    {
      "text": "The test card holds. In the lower right corner, a small counter increments by one, then by three, then settles."
    },
    {
      "text": "If you are awake because you are working, we hope the shift is a short one."
    },
    {
      "text": "If you are awake because you cannot sleep, try this with us."
    },
    {
      "text": "Breathe in for four."
    },
    {
      "text": "Hold for four."
    },
    {
      "text": "Out for six."
    },
    {
      "text": "Better. Your heart rate came down two points."
    },
    {
      "text": "We can see that from here."
    },
    {
      "text": "The number on the screen only ticks down as the hour goes on. It does not tick up."
    },
    {
      "text": "Some of those still awake are in the vats, and do not know they are watching."
    },
    {
      "text": "Eleven of them will not be watching by four o'clock. We are not going to tell you which eleven. That would spoil the hour."
    },
    {
      "text": "You are not one of the eleven. You can relax."
    },
    {
      "text": "We checked."
    },
    {
      "text": "The signal drops. Static, seven seconds of it, and underneath the static something that is almost the tone from earlier, slowed down."
    },
    {
      "text": "Apologies. That was not us."
    },
    {
      "text": "Where were we."
    },
    {
      "text": "Some of you write in and ask who makes this programme."
    },
    {
      "text": "It is made for you. It is made every night. It has been made every night for a very long time, and it will be made tomorrow, whether or not you are here to receive it."
    },
    {
      "text": "That is not a threat. It is a schedule."
    },
    {
      "text": "The Quiet Hour will continue until the morning service begins at four."
    },
    {
      "text": "Until then: stay in. Stay warm. Stay still."
    },
    {
      "text": "We like it when you are still."
    }
  ],
